[{"text": "The assembly will now hear an address", "start": 1.68, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "by his excellency", "start": 5.52, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "Tolam,", "start": 7.6, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "general secretary of the Communist Party", "start": 9.28, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "of Vietnam and President of the Social", "start": 11.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Republic of Vietnam.", "start": 14.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 16.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "excellency and to invite him to address", "start": 19.6, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "the assembly.", "start": 22.48, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "distinguished guest, ladies and", "start": 41.84, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "gentlemen, the world is undergoing", "start": 43.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "profound shift in the international", "start": 45.92, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "order with many risk and uncertainties.", "start": 47.76, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "The tendency towards the threat or use", "start": 50.719, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "of force and the arms race, especially", "start": 52.879, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "the modernization of nuclear weapons and", "start": 55.36, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "the development of new technology", "start": 57.68, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "weapons are heightening the risk of", "start": 60.079, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "confrontation, miscalculation, conflict,", "start": 62.399, "duration": 6.001}, {"text": "and even of largecale wars. At the same", "start": 65.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "time, the global economy is becoming", "start": 68.4, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "increasingly fragmented amid mounting", "start": 70.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "barriers to trade, investment, and", "start": 73.2, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "technology. Supply chain disruptions and", "start": 74.96, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "economic instability are narrowing", "start": 77.92, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "development opportunities for many", "start": 80.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "countries. Climate change, natural", "start": 81.68, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "disasters, pandemics and emerging", "start": 84.24, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "technological risk continue to pose", "start": 86.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "direct threats to the pe lives of the", "start": 88.4, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "people and their livelihoods and to the", "start": 90.72, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "development and stability of many", "start": 92.799, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "nations. The shift in the balance of", "start": 94.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "power and development inequalities are", "start": 96.64, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "placing growing strains on international", "start": 98.88, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "relations. Instability is further", "start": 101.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "exacerbated when competitions goes", "start": 103.84, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "unchecked. Commitments are left", "start": 106.56, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "unfulfilled and international law is", "start": 108.479, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "applied selectively and erosion of trust", "start": 110.88, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "is further impeding efforts at", "start": 113.439, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "cooperation. What should concern us is", "start": 115.439, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "not only how the international order is", "start": 117.68, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "changing but where that change will take", "start": 119.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "the world. Change is inevitable for it", "start": 121.92, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "is part of the objective course of", "start": 124.96, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "history. However, conflict and", "start": 127.28, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "confrontation are not inevitable. From", "start": 129.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "our own history, Vietnam understands the", "start": 132.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "cost of war, the value of independence,", "start": 134.959, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "and the power of reconciliation and", "start": 137.28, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "cooperation. It is therefore my belief", "start": 139.599, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "that the theme of the session, restoring", "start": 141.84, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "trust, managing transformation, a UN", "start": 144.08, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "that delivers for all aptly reflects the", "start": 146.64, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "urgent demands of the term.", "start": 149.36, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Distinguished guest, from the losses of", "start": 151.84, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "the Second World War, humanity created", "start": 154.319, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "the UN with the aspiration to prevent", "start": 156.64, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "wars, safeguard peace, promote", "start": 159.28, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "cooperation, and place relations among", "start": 161.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "nations on the foundation of common", "start": 163.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "principles. Over the past eight decades,", "start": 166.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "despite its limitations, the UN has", "start": 168.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "helped sustain dialogue, advance", "start": 170.8, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "decolonization, uphold the right of", "start": 173.28, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "peoples to self-determination, and", "start": 175.76, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "support development. This must be", "start": 177.44, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "preserved and carried forward. Our", "start": 179.519, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "institutions must be reformed to keep", "start": 181.68, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "pace with the terms while fundamental", "start": 183.519, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "principles of the UN charter must be", "start": 185.84, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "respected and reinforced. What we seek", "start": 187.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "is a more equitable, democratic and", "start": 190.4, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "inclusive international order where", "start": 192.56, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "every country has a voice and every", "start": 194.64, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "nation has the opportunity to develop.", "start": 196.4, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "The mission of our generation is to help", "start": 199.28, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "shape and manage change so that", "start": 201.92, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "competition does not turn into", "start": 204.319, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "confrontation. Differences do not lead", "start": 205.84, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "to conflict and advances in science and", "start": 208.08, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "technology do not create new divides. In", "start": 210.48, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "this spirit, I wish to put forward four", "start": 213.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "key priorities. First, we must restore", "start": 215.519, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "trust among nations on the basis of", "start": 218.72, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "respect for the UN charter and", "start": 220.64, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "international law. The UN charter and", "start": 222.4, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "international law form the foundation", "start": 224.959, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "for the international order. They must", "start": 227.599, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "be respected fully, consistently, and", "start": 229.76, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "without selectivity. All states must", "start": 231.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "respect one each other's independence,", "start": 234.48, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "sovereignty, territorial integrity, and", "start": 237.28, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "right to choose their own path of", "start": 239.68, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "development, refrain from interference", "start": 241.599, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "in internal affairs, and refrain from", "start": 243.76, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "the threat or use a force inconsistent", "start": 245.599, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "with the UN charter. Restoring trust", "start": 248.0, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "does not require countries to erase", "start": 250.239, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "differences, but rather to manage such", "start": 252.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "differences responsibly. Crisis must be", "start": 254.4, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "prevented, competition must be kept", "start": 257.12, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "under control, and dialogue must be", "start": 259.04, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "sustained. Major powers should lead by", "start": 260.88, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "example in respecting international law,", "start": 263.6, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "exercising restraint and responsibly", "start": 265.6, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "addressing common challenges and the UN", "start": 267.759, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "must remain at the heart of these", "start": 269.68, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "efforts. In every conflict, civilians", "start": 271.52, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "must be protected. International", "start": 273.759, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "humanitarian law must be respected and", "start": 275.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "humanitarian access must be ensured.", "start": 278.479, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "Vietnam supports the rise of the", "start": 280.639, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "Palestinian people to self-determination", "start": 282.08, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "and the two-stage solution with an", "start": 284.479, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "independent state of Palestine living", "start": 286.32, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "peacefully alongside the state of Israel", "start": 288.56, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "in line with international law and", "start": 290.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "relevant UN resolutions in the", "start": 292.8, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "Asia-Pacific. Nearly six decades of the", "start": 294.72, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "Asan's development have demonstrated", "start": 297.199, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "that countries can transform suspicion", "start": 299.199, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "into trust, confrontation into dialogue,", "start": 301.6, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "division into cooperation, and", "start": 304.08, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "individual strength into collective", "start": 305.759, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "might. In that spirit, Vietnam remains", "start": 308.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "steadfast in its commitment to resolving", "start": 310.72, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "disputes, including those in the East", "start": 312.88, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Sea. By peaceful means in line with", "start": 314.8, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "international law, particularly the 1982", "start": 317.12, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "ANC clause, Vietnam is resolute in", "start": 319.919, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "safeguarding it sovereignty, sovereign", "start": 322.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "rights, and jurisdiction. The seas and", "start": 323.919, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "oceans must remain spaces", "start": 326.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "of peace, cooperation, connectivity, and", "start": 329.44, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "sustainable development.", "start": 332.08, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "In this same spirit of peace and respect", "start": 334.16, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "for people's rights to development,", "start": 336.24, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "Vietnam has always stood in solidarity", "start": 337.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "with the state and people of Cuba, we", "start": 339.919, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "call upon the US to end the unilateral", "start": 342.08, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "embargo and in sanctions and the energy", "start": 344.479, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "blocket against Cuba and remove Cuba", "start": 346.88, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "from the list of state sponsors of", "start": 349.199, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "terrorism. We also call upon the", "start": 350.88, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "international community to support Cuba", "start": 352.96, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "in overcoming the sanction induced", "start": 355.12, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "crisis. Second, we must advance", "start": 357.039, "duration": 5.961}, {"text": "development that is equitable,", "start": 359.12, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "humane, and inclusive and sustainable.", "start": 363.039, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "International commitments must be", "start": 365.039, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "translated into action and bring people", "start": 366.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "lives of peace, security, dignity, and", "start": 369.52, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "happiness. It is for this reason that", "start": 371.52, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "the pact for the future and the 2030", "start": 373.44, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "agenda. Our promises to present and", "start": 375.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "future generations must be implemented", "start": 377.919, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "earnestly and in full. Commitments on", "start": 380.4, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "financing for development, including the", "start": 383.199, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Sevilla commitment,", "start": 385.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "must be translated into concrete", "start": 387.919, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "measures expanding access to long-term", "start": 390.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "financing at affordable cost, supporting", "start": 392.479, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "countries burdened by debt, and", "start": 395.44, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "amplifying the voice of developing", "start": 397.759, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "countries in international financial and", "start": 399.52, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "monetary institutions. The multilateral", "start": 402.08, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "trading system must be strengthened in", "start": 404.4, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "an open, equitable, and transparent", "start": 406.16, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "manner, ensuring development", "start": 408.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "opportunities for all countries. Climate", "start": 409.84, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "action must be accorded its rightful", "start": 412.24, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "place in development cooperation", "start": 414.319, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "particularly via adaptation finance", "start": 416.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "technology transfer and a just energy", "start": 419.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "transition. Development must be people", "start": 421.44, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "centered and leave no one behind. Growth", "start": 424.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "must go handinhand with social progress", "start": 426.4, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "and equity environmental protection and", "start": 428.56, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "the safeguarding of people's livelihoods", "start": 430.96, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "especially for vulnerable countries and", "start": 433.36, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "communities. Global progress must uphold", "start": 435.199, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "the spirit of humanity in relations", "start": 438.319, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "among nations. Safeguard their", "start": 440.16, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "legitimate interests and respect", "start": 442.16, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "differences in history, culture and", "start": 443.759, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "development conditions. Third, we must", "start": 445.68, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "proactively shape technology governance", "start": 448.0, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "so that progress serves humanity and our", "start": 450.479, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "common development. Science, technology,", "start": 453.599, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "digital transformation, and artificial", "start": 456.4, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "intelligence are opening up", "start": 458.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "unprecedented opportunities.", "start": 460.16, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "But they're also presenting new", "start": 462.72, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "challenges. The future of technology", "start": 464.08, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "does not automatically guarantee", "start": 466.08, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "equitability and technological progress", "start": 468.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "must help narrow divides and expand", "start": 470.8, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "development opportunities rather than", "start": 472.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "creating new forms of dependency on new", "start": 474.96, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "sources of conflict. We need to develop", "start": 477.44, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "inclusive, safe, transparent and", "start": 479.84, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "accountable principles and governance", "start": 481.84, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "frameworks to ensure that technologies", "start": 483.599, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "will be in service of the people while", "start": 485.759, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "respecting national sovereignty, digital", "start": 487.919, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "sovereignty and the right to", "start": 489.919, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "development. Developing countries must", "start": 491.52, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "be able to participate substantively in", "start": 493.919, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "rule making, receive support for", "start": 496.319, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "infrastructure and digital capacity and", "start": 498.96, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "enjoy equitable access to the benefits", "start": 500.879, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "of scientific and technological", "start": 503.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "progress. Vietnam's hosting of the uh", "start": 504.879, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "signing ceremony for the UN convention", "start": 508.8, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "against cyber crime in Hanoi last year", "start": 510.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "reflects our desire to make substantive", "start": 513.279, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "contributions to global digital", "start": 515.36, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "cooperation. Vietnam stands ready to", "start": 516.959, "duration": 3.361}, {"text": "work with partners to strengthen", "start": 519.039, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "cooperation and build capacity in", "start": 520.32, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "preventing and combating cyber crime so", "start": 522.64, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "that people may leave safely and benefit", "start": 524.8, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "from technological progress. We also", "start": 527.36, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "stand ready to support international", "start": 529.76, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "initiatives on green and digital", "start": 531.44, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "transformation and the development of", "start": 533.36, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "effective governance framework so that", "start": 535.519, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "science and technology can truly become", "start": 537.279, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "drivers of shared development.", "start": 539.68, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Fourth, we must strengthen", "start": 542.32, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "multilateralism and the essential", "start": 543.92, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "indispensable role of the UN. The", "start": 546.0, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "strength of the UN does not lie in its", "start": 548.399, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "ability to replace the responsibilities", "start": 550.399, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "of state, but in its legitimacy and", "start": 552.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "capacity to build consensus, establish", "start": 555.279, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "norms, develop rules, and mobilize", "start": 557.44, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "global efforts to address common", "start": 559.519, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "challenges for the UN to adapt to the", "start": 561.12, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "transformations of the time. Vietnam", "start": 563.36, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "supports efforts to reform the", "start": 565.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "organization, particularly the GA, the", "start": 567.279, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "security council and the secretariat", "start": 570.56, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "with a view to enhance effectiveness,", "start": 572.72, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "prioritizing structural reform and", "start": 574.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "streamlining the apparatus while fully", "start": 576.959, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "harnessing the UN's advantage in", "start": 579.12, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "advancing global agendas and", "start": 581.2, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "safeguarding the interests of developing", "start": 582.64, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "countries.", "start": 584.64, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "These perspective are drawn from the", "start": 586.32, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "experience of Vietnam itself over the", "start": 588.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "past half century since it succession to", "start": 590.8, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the UN mirrors the transformation of our", "start": 593.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "own country from primarily a recipient", "start": 595.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "of invaluable assistance during the", "start": 599.2, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "years of DUI. Vietnam today is making", "start": 600.8, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "proactive contributions to our common", "start": 603.519, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "endeavors while deepening and broadening", "start": 605.519, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "our substantive relations with the UN.", "start": 607.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Vietnamese military personnel and police", "start": 610.0, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "officers have served and will continue", "start": 612.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "to serve in UN peacekeeping operations", "start": 614.48, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "carrying our nation's aspiration for", "start": 617.12, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "peace to places where peace remains", "start": 619.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "fragile. Our tradition for of", "start": 621.6, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "independence and several lands provides", "start": 624.0, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "a foundation for Vietnam to strengthen", "start": 626.16, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "its strategic autonomy and proactively", "start": 627.92, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "pursue international integration.", "start": 630.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Looking towards our goal of becoming a", "start": 632.64, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "developing country with a modern", "start": 634.56, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "industrial base and upper middle income", "start": 636.399, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "by 2030 and developed high-income", "start": 638.56, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "country by 2045. Vietnam is establishing", "start": 641.279, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "a new development model based on", "start": 644.64, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "productivity, quality, and added value", "start": 646.32, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "with science, technology, innovation,", "start": 648.8, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "and digital transformation as key", "start": 651.44, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "drivers with economic growth closely", "start": 653.04, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "linked to cultural development, social", "start": 655.2, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "progress, and equity, and environmental", "start": 657.04, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "protection. Autonomy also means", "start": 659.36, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "proactively adapting and cooperating", "start": 661.6, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "with the world on an equal footing.", "start": 663.36, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "Vietnam therefore pursues a consistent", "start": 665.36, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "foreign policy of independence,", "start": 667.279, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "autonomy, self-reliance, peace,", "start": 669.12, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "friendship, cooperation and development,", "start": 670.959, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "and of multilateralization and", "start": 673.04, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "diversification of external relations.", "start": 674.8, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "Vietnam will remain steadfast in", "start": 677.04, "duration": 3.039}, {"text": "upholding the UN charter and", "start": 678.72, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "international law, promoting dialogue on", "start": 680.079, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "the peaceful settlement of disputes and", "start": 682.399, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "deepening its participation in UN", "start": 684.079, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "peacekeeping missions. Vietnam is", "start": 686.24, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "working with fellow ASEAN member states", "start": 688.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "to build a united self-real and", "start": 690.0, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "resilient ASEAN and actively preparing", "start": 692.56, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "to host APEC in 2027. And as a member of", "start": 694.399, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "the UN Human Rights Council, Vietnam", "start": 697.519, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "champions dialogue and cooperation in", "start": 699.44, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "promoting and protecting human rights", "start": 701.519, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "and in ensuring that all can share the", "start": 703.12, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "fruits of development. We stand ready to", "start": 705.36, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "share our experience in poverty", "start": 707.36, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "reduction, agricultural development and", "start": 708.8, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "climate change adaptation to work with", "start": 710.88, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "partners to broaden cooperation for", "start": 713.12, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "common interest. The world will continue", "start": 715.12, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "to change. The direction for such change", "start": 717.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "will depend on the choices we make and", "start": 720.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the responsibilities we shoulder today.", "start": 722.88, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "Vietnam chooses peace, cooperation, and", "start": 725.6, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "development. We will work steadfastly", "start": 728.079, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "with all countries to strengthen the UN,", "start": 730.079, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "uphold international law, and translate", "start": 732.48, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "our shared commitments into tangible", "start": 734.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "benefits for our people. We believe that", "start": 736.56, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "with a strong UN together we can build a", "start": 740.079, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "more peaceful, equitable, inclusive and", "start": 744.0, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "better world for all. And on this", "start": 747.68, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "journey Vietnam will remain an active", "start": 750.079, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "member, a reliable partner and a", "start": 753.279, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "responsible nation, always standing", "start": 756.48, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "ready to contribute to the common", "start": 759.04, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "endeavors of the international", "start": 760.8, "duration": 3.279}, {"text": "community.", "start": 762.48, "duration": 5.4}, {"text": "Thank you very much.", "start": 764.079, "duration": 3.801}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 773.6, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "thank the general secretary of the", "start": 776.56, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "Communist Party of Vietnam and the", "start": 777.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "president of the Social Republic of", "start": 780.32, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "Vietnam.", "start": 782.8, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We shall now continue the general", "start": 787.04, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "debate.", "start": 789.2, "duration": 3.0}]